OL,3,GNEWSACouncil that ran up #1.8bn debt
OL,4,Aagrees #51m services cuts
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council which built up debts of
OL,7,F#1.8bn after a failed commercial
OL,8,Finvestment programme has approved
OL,9,Fmaking #51m of cuts.
OL,11,FWarrington Borough Council invested in
OL,12,Fan energy firm which collapsed, as well
OL,13,Fas a bank, a Texan oil firm and
OL,14,Fproperty across the country.
OL,16,FCouncillors have now approved plans to
OL,17,Fmake significant cuts to adult social
OL,18,Fcare, as well as cutting more than 200
OL,19,Fjobs.
